    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-murray-mammalian-coat-markings-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Murray (1981) Thomas substrate-inhibition reaction-diffusion pre-pattern, conical tail spot-to-ring transition & P1 surface-FEM felid body — Morphometric validation: 84/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L1513-1676) now emits 14 measurements: the four exact analytic quantities (u0, d_c, gamma*k_c^2, r_crit; error 0), the gamma-vs-mode-count Pearson r = 0.9996, both negative controls (std_u 8.6e-15 and 4.1e-16), the specimen Delaunay CV (0.296 vs 0.24), the FEM m = 1 eigenvalue error (3.1e-14), the FEM tail ring onset (0.817 measured vs 0.858 predicted from r_excl), the FEM torso annularity (0.84 vs planar 0.80), the G = 1 null (0.0) and the FEM marking density (5.09 vs 18.9). It also RETRACTS the v2 headline: the conical suppression ratio on the v2 geometry is 0.90, not 865.5, and this is carried as an explicit disclosure measurement (L1636-1647); the new ratio (9.86 vs reference 5.0) is on a thinner tail chosen so that r_excl is reached. Weaknesses: the annularity reference (0.8) is the script's own planar run, not a literature value; the ring-onset reference is linear theory on a surrogate taper; the marking-density measurement fails by 3.7x; and no measurement uses segmented rosette morphology from the specimen." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "1981-murray-mammalian-coat-markings.py L1636–L1647: v2 865x suppression ratio retracted: stable solver on the v2 geometry gives 0.90 (no exclusion zone) <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/64526a0/1981-murray-mammalian-coat-markings.py#L1636-L1647>",
            "1981-murray-mammalian-coat-markings.py L565–L592: Annularity index (rim-vs-core of Stage-1 cores in the Stage-2 field) -- a self-defined statistic, not a literature morphometric <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/64526a0/1981-murray-mammalian-coat-markings.py#L565-L592>" ;
        pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-murray-mammalian-coat-markings-measurement-conical-tail-critical-circumferential-cutoff-radius-r-crit-m-1>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-murray-mammalian-coat-markings-measurement-conical-tail-pde-proximal-to-distal-circumferential-spot-suppression-ratio>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-murray-mammalian-coat-markings-measurement-conical-tail-pde-suppression-ratio-on-the-v2-geometry-r-tip-0-35-r-excl-v2-artifact-disclosure>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-murray-mammalian-coat-markings-measurement-equal-diffusion-d-1-and-non-inhibitory-k-0-negative-control-amplitude-suppression>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-murray-mammalian-coat-markings-measurement-fem-felid-body-tail-spot-to-ring-transition-position-measured-vs-full-exclusion-prediction-r-excl-1-k>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-murray-mammalian-coat-markings-measurement-fem-stage-2-torso-markings-per-torso-depth-vs-specimen-estimate>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-murray-mammalian-coat-markings-measurement-p1-surface-fem-laplace-beltrami-m-1-cylinder-eigenvalue-relative-error>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-murray-mammalian-coat-markings-measurement-scale-factor-gamma-vs-unstable-eigenmode-count-pearson-r>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-murray-mammalian-coat-markings-measurement-segmented-panthera-pardus-kruger-flank-inter-rosette-delaunay-wavelength-cv>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-murray-mammalian-coat-markings-measurement-thomas-critical-diffusivity-ratio-d-c>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-murray-mammalian-coat-markings-measurement-thomas-steady-state-substrate-concentration-u0>,
