            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-murray-mammalian-coat-markings-measurement-two-stage-annularity-index-with-no-growth-g-1-null-control-planar>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-murray-mammalian-coat-markings-measurement-two-stage-stage-2-annularity-index-on-the-fem-torso-at-growth-factor-g-2>,
